{"version":1,"content":"<p>英特爾表示，位於美國亞利桑那州錢德勒市奧科蒂洛園區的Fab 62已進入設備安裝階段，廠房建設和生產設備進場正同步進行，公司預計該廠在2028年底前開始運營。英特爾代工部門首席技術與運營官納迦·錢德拉塞卡蘭稱，這是公司在奧科蒂洛園區的第六座高產能製造廠。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583450.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T22:39:59.869833+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T22:23:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.525278+00:00","content_hash":"18d5d8c3bb912702566526ddea512b5874bb00365511632392f1c978bbe60799","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}